A retype makes a frame with every right rather than the Untyped's,
so a borrower lent read and write gets execute as well.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-grain32 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: slot is not derived from its parent

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -229,7 +229,7 @@ static int op_untyped(struct thread *t, uint32_t slot, const struct cap *cap,
             c = cap_to_object(&pool->hdr, RIGHT_ALL);
             parent = &pool->node;
         } else if (type == CAP_FRAME) {
-            c = cap_to_frame(at, len, cap->rights);
+            c = cap_to_frame(at, len, RIGHT_ALL);
         } else {
             c = cap_to_untyped(at, len, cap->rights);
         }
